    "description": "A View From My Seat is a community driven photo sharing app for sports, concert and theatre event-goers.\r\n\r\nThe concept is simple. When you're at an event, share a photo, your comments and a rating for your seat. Next time you're thinking of getting tickets to an event, use this app to look around the venue and find great seats. Don't end up with an obstructed view. Find the best place to watch a show or game, see the mascot or simply stay cool on a hot day.\r\n\r\nThis app grows and gets better as you share your photos. This app is a simple way for us, as fans, to help each other have great experiences.\r\n\r\nBTW, This app is ad-free, and alway will be.\r\n\r\nThis app is a great compliment to any ticket site including StubHub, SeatGeek and TicketMaster. No matter who you use to buy tickets, use A View From My Seat to know what you're getting.\r\n\r\nSome Fun Features\r\n\r\nSchedules & Tickets\r\nSee when your favorite teams or bands are playing, and when tickets are cheap.\r\n\r\nTrophies\r\nYou can earn trophies every time you share a photo. You can earn Phillies Fan by sharing a few photos from Citizens Bank Park or become a Bat Boy for sharing baseball photos in general. Really active users can become a Manager, Coach or Announcer. There are over 500 trophies in all.\r\n\r\nSocial Connections\r\nTo make photo sharing more convenient, A View From My Seat can tie into your Facebook &Twitter accounts. This allows you to share a photo once and have it automatically cataloged in aviewfrommyseat.com, sent to your Facebook wall and posted with a shortened url to your Twitter. Your photo can be on 3 sites with 1 click.\r\n\r\nDriving Directions\r\nFor all the fans out there that love a good road trip, we've built in driving directions. Great for Spring Training! \r\n\r\nHotels\r\nFind a place to stay near the stadium or ballpark with hotel listing powered by Priceline.\r\n\r\nFavorites\r\nTo make finding photos from your favorite venues even more convenient, you can have favorites. Add all your favorite stadiums, ball parks and teams to your favorites for one click access to new photos from those venues as they are shared.\r\n\r\nWorldwide\r\nA View From My Seat in not limited to just U.S. venues, it can work anywhere in the world with an internet connection. Help us grow in your community by sharing the view from your seats.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis app was created by fans, for fans. Together, we've helped 1 in 10 fans find better seats.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatured on ESPN, Yahoo Sports, Bleacher Report and many, many more.",
